  "summary": "I'm a Software Engineer. I enjoy turning ideas into products and features that add functionality and value to life. My passion lies in creating and refining solutions - I’m a problem solver.\n\nWith expertise in systems architecture and application development, I’ve developed products and features to deliver ever-increasing bandwidth to users of communications systems, focusing on the configuration, fault detection and reporting and performance monitoring of access networks.\n\nI am looking to contribute to a creative team effort while continuing to learn and innovate.\n\nA listing of my core competencies includes:\n✔ Software Design, Coding\n✔ Software Architecture\n✔ Software Test and Verification\n✔ Agile Methodologies, Scrum, XP\n✔ Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)\n✔ Redundancy, High-Availability (HA)\n\nAvailable to discuss new opportunities in the RDU area or virtual (remote), please contact me at bomgard@yahoo.com\n\nTECHNICAL SKILLS:\nC / C++, Java, Python, Assembly languages\nGit, Mercurial, Make, Confluence, Jira, Bitbucket\nNetconf/Yang, SNMP, CLI, TL1\nL2/L3 Networking Protocols\n\n",
